WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.400
[Soft ambient instrumental music]
A little more space. A lot more possibility.

00:03.400 --> 00:09.400
Less clutter. More you.
Your tabs. Your workspaces. Your own way to explore.

00:09.400 --> 00:14.400
Big ideas. Local intelligence.
Supported models run on your device with WebGPU.

00:14.400 --> 00:19.400
Your world. Within reach.
Pair computers and sync bookmarks and passwords with encryption.

00:19.400 --> 00:23.000
An open browser. A shared possibility.
Free to use. Built in the open. Licensed under MIT.

00:23.000 --> 00:27.000
Make a little room for Nova.
Free for macOS, Windows and Linux. nova-browser.org
